	#[doc = r#"This element indicates whether or not approval is required by default for Requirement execution.  The default can be overridden in specific conditions as indicated by the sibling ByRequirementPolicy element.  For example, an ApprovalPolicy could use this element to indicate that approval is required before executing Requirements by default and then use the sibling ByRequirementPolicy element to specify conditions when execution approval is not required such as for EA and Collection Tasks.  Alternately, this element could indicate that approval is not required by default and then use ByRequirementPolicy to specify conditions when is required, such as for Strike Tasks.  Creators of this message are expected to carefully avoid creating logically inconsistent policies and therefore no guidance is given on deconflicting illogical instances.  For example, an ApprovalPolicy that indicates approval is not required by default with conflicting ByRequirementPolicy overrides of 1) ApprovalRequired=TRUE for SAR Tasks and 2) ApprovalRequired=FALSE for SAR Tasks would be considered illogical."#]
